Nethack is not the easiest game to complete in the world without
cheating, and as it turns out, with cheating. Here are some don'ts and
do's:


Do not:
Get discouraged.
Quit playing nethack.
Stop asking questions.


Do:
Read every spoiler you can get your hands on (it makes the game 100
time more fun for me).
Post questions to this newsgroup, no matter how dumb you think they
are (look at some of my posts for example).
Stick to playing the same character for at least a little while, so
you get used to that characters quirks.
Get your buddies interested and have your own nethack tournaments with
cash payouts to the winner (I did). Also a good idea to make sure they
are worse than you.
Colaborate as much as possible to get as informed about the game as
you can.
BE PATIENT!


